OL,3,ALatest figures on young people not in
OL,4,Awork or education set to be released
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest figures on the number of
OL,7,Fyoung people aged 16 to 24 not in
OL,8,Feducation, employment or training will
OL,9,Fbe released at 09:30 BST
OL,11,FThe number of so-called Neets rose
OL,12,Fabove one million in January to March -
OL,13,Fthe highest figure in 12 years,
OL,14,Faccording to the Office for National
OL,15,FStatistics (ONS)
OL,17,FFormer Labour minister Alan Milburn,
OL,18,Fwho authored a government-commissioned
OL,19,Freport on Neets, said the figures
OL,20,Fshowed this was "more than an economic
OL,21,Fcrisis, it is a moral one" - his final
OL,22,Freport is expected in the coming weeks
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
