OL,3,ALatest figures on young people not in
OL,4,Awork or education set to be released
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork and Pensions Secretary Pat
OL,7,FMcFadden says the labour market is in a
OL,8,F"robust position" but there has been a
OL,9,F"long-term challenge for young people"
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said
OL,12,Fhe's "on a mission" to reduce the
OL,13,Fnumber of Neets - but has not put a
OL,14,Fdate to his ambition
